Hello,

Thank you for your interest in AIVA!

If your company generates less than $300 000 in annual revenue and has a
team of less than 3 full-time employees, you can use our Pro plan.

If your company generates more than $300 000 and has a team of more than 3
full-time employees, you will need an Enterprise plan.

As our enterprise plans are custom made, I need the following information
to provide you more details on the Enterprise plan pricing:

1. Your exact use-case
2. The number of accounts you need (the number of staff that needs to
access and use AVA)
3. The number of compositions you need per month
4. The size of your company (the number of full-time employees)
5. The website link to your company

Let's say at the moment your company is small and does not qualify for our
enterprise plan, you can use our Pro plan.
In the future, when your company grows and qualifies for an enterprise
customer,
you can contact us again, and we will create a new custom Enterprise plan
tailored to your needs.
Any compositions you created and downloaded in the past under the Pro plan
will retain their original Pro license and you can continue using them
commercially.
Only the new tracks that you will create under the Enterprise plan, will
have the new Enterprise licence.

Please let me know if you have any questions!

Regards,

